              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "انگریز — angrez — \"an English person\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "انگریز سو سال یہاں رہے۔ angrez sau sāl yahāṅ rahe. The English stayed here for a hundred years."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine or feminine, by the person meant."
