              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سونپنا (saunpnā) is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin saũpnā, \"hands over\", under Sanskrit sámarpayati (CDIAL 13192). The one who receives takes کو, and the verb follows the thing: تخت سونپا."
            }
          ]
        },
